In order to make recommendations to the Board of Commissioners of Fayette County as to the formulation of current and long-range water plans for Fayette County, the Fayette County Water Committee is hereby reaffirmed and re-established. The Fayette County Water Committee shall be organized and empowered as set out in this division. The Fayette County Water Committee shall be created for the following purposes:
(1) To fully explore water issues concerning Fayette County citizens;
(2) To provide recommendations for short- and long-term priorities;
